      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تقافزوا</span></b>  [<i>They contended together,</i> or <i>vied, one
with another, in leaping, jumping, springing,</i> or
<i>bounding</i>]. You say so of children playing at
the game called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُفَّيْزَى</span>. (A, K.)

